   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Alpha Negative**: back after 109 archived shows (1890 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Alphabetizing**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Pseudothyrum Song**: back after 43 archived shows (525 days); rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Genesis 3:23**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Going to Georgia**: back after 130 archived shows (2278 days) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2023-02-16** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 107 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- The reviewer couldn't attend, having given away their ticket, and hoped someone would tape the show [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2023-02-16**: taped by Liz Hamilton; transferred by Liz Hamilton; source: Zoom H1 Handy Recorder [1]. Also: The reviewer credits a taper called rationalfish for the recording [2]",
